---
title: "Sequence 1 - Organiser submits a request (SCRUM-19/22/51/63)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Org as Organiser
    participant API as events.py<br/>POST /events/{id}/submit
    participant Auth as auth.py<br/>get_current_user
    participant RR as assignment.py<br/>round-robin
    participant N as notifications.py
    participant DB as Database

    Org->>API: submit(event_id) + session cookie
    API->>Auth: who is calling?
    Auth->>DB: look up valid LoginSession
    alt no / invalid session
        Auth-->>Org: 401 Not authenticated
    end
    Auth-->>API: current user

    API->>API: role must be organiser (else 403)
    API->>DB: load Event
    alt event not found
        API-->>Org: 404
    else not this organiser's event
        API-->>Org: 403
    else status not Draft / Returned, or rules fail
        API-->>Org: 400
    end

    API->>API: status = Submitted

    opt no Coordinator assigned yet (first submission)
        API->>RR: assign_coordinator_on_submission(event)
        RR->>DB: active coordinators + latest assignment times
        alt no active coordinator
            RR-->>API: NoCoordinatorAvailable
            API->>DB: rollback
            API-->>Org: 400 "No active coordinator available"
        end
        RR->>DB: set assigned_coordinator_id, add CoordinatorAssignmentHistory, commit
        RR-->>API: assigned
    end

    API->>DB: add EventStatusHistory (Draft/Returned -> Submitted)
    API->>N: notify_organiser_of_status(SUBMITTED)
    N->>N: can_see_event(organiser)? (else NotEntitled)
    N->>DB: add Notification "submitted" -> Organiser

    opt newly assigned (SCRUM-63)
        API->>N: notify_first_assignment(event)
        N->>DB: add Notification "coordinator_assigned" -> Organiser (names Coordinator)
        N->>DB: add Notification "assigned_to_you" -> Coordinator
    end

    API->>DB: commit
    API-->>Org: 200 {status: Submitted, assigned_coordinator_id}
